     "@en": "To say that, as something has happened, the consequence is logical: phrase in normal form + **いじょう は**: **やくそく した いじょうは、 まもります** (since I have promised, I will fulfill it)."
    },
    {
     "@es": "Se escribe 以上は, pero en kana es いじょうは.",
     "@en": "It is written 以上は, but in kana it is いじょうは."
    }
   ]
